      "handle": "azure-palm-baby-doll-dress",
      "body_html": "<p data-start=\"87\" data-end=\"125\">🌴 <strong data-start=\"90\" data-end=\"120\">Azure Palm Baby Doll Dress</strong> 🌴</p><p data-start=\"127\" data-end=\"258\">Float through sunlit days in our <em data-start=\"160\" data-end=\"188\">Azure Palm Baby Doll Dress</em>, a carefree piece that blends tropical charm with relaxed elegance.</p><p data-start=\"260\" data-end=\"621\">This lightweight rayon mini dress features a dreamy palm and villa-inspired print in soft pastel hues, evoking the spirit of island adventures. The button-down front adds a touch of structure, while the loose, tiered silhouette creates an airy, flattering flow. Drawstring details on the sleeves bring a playful boho twist, letting you adjust for comfort and style.</p><p data-start=\"623\" data-end=\"871\"> The Azure Palm Baby Doll Dress is your go-to for effortless chic.  Pair it with sandals and bangles for daytime wanderings or elevate with wedges for a breezy night out.</p><p data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"955\">✨ <strong data-start=\"875\" data-end=\"889\">Style tip:</strong> Add a woven tote and sun hat for the ultimate boho-travel look.</p><table class=\"t1\" style=\"height: 346px;\" width=\"298\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"td1\" valign=\"top\"><p class=\"p1\"><strong><span class=\"s1\">Size</span></strong></p></td>\n<td class=\"td1\" valign=\"top\"><p class=\"p1\"><strong><span class=\"s1\">Bust</span></strong></p></td>\n<td class=\"td1\" valign=\"top\"><p class=\"p1\"><strong><span class=\"s1\">Length</span></strong></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"td1\" valign=\"top\"><p class=\"p1\"><strong><span class=\"s1\">8</span></strong></p></td>\n<td class=\"td1\" valign=\"top\"><p class=\"p1\"><strong><span class=\"s1\">94cm</span></strong></p></td>\n<td class=\"td1\" valign=\"top\"><p class=\"p1\"><strong><span class=\"s1\">90cm</span></strong></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"td1\" valign=\"top\"><p class=\"p1\"><strong><span class=\"