      "body_html": "<p data-start=\"144\" data-end=\"352\">Effortlessly elegant and beautifully relaxed, the <strong data-start=\"194\" data-end=\"227\">Rosewater Bloom Palazzo Pants</strong> feature the same dreamy floral print as the matching maxi dress — soft rose, peach, and cream tones on a powder-blue base.</p><p data-start=\"354\" data-end=\"623\">Crafted from <strong data-start=\"367\" data-end=\"393\">100% lightweight rayon</strong>, these wide-leg pants offer a breezy, free-flowing silhouette with a comfortable <strong data-start=\"475\" data-end=\"503\">elastic drawstring waist</strong> and practical side pockets. Perfect for pairing with the matching blouse or the Luna Cami for an easy boho-luxe look.</p><p data-start=\"625\" data-end=\"666\"><strong data-start=\"625\" data-end=\"664\">Available in Australian sizes 8–16.</strong></p><h2 data-start=\"74\" data-end=\"105\"><strong data-start=\"77\" data-end=\"105\">Palazzo Pants Size Chart</strong></h2><div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\"><div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\"><table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"107\" data-end=\"406\">\n<thead data-start=\"107\" data-end=\"166\"><tr data-start=\"107\" data-end=\"166\">\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"107\" data-end=\"126\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Measurement (cm)</th>\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"126\" data-end=\"133\" data-col-size=\"sm\">AU 8</th>\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"133\" data-end=\"141\" data-col-size=\"sm\">AU 10</th>\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"141\" data-end=\"149\" data-col-size=\"sm\">AU 12</th>\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"149\" data-end=\"157\" data-col-size=\"sm\">AU 14</th>\n<th class=\"\" data-start=\"157\" data-end=\"166\" data-col-size=\"sm\">AU 16</th>\n</tr></thead>\n<tbody data-start=\"227\" data-end=\"406\">\n<tr data-start=\"227\" data-end=\"286\">\n<td data-start=\"227\" data-end=\"246\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"229\" data-end=\"238\">Wai