      "title": "Woodstock Wanderer Knit Cardi",
      "handle": "woodstock-wanderer-knit-cardi",
      "body_html": "<p data-start=\"103\" data-end=\"380\">Channel effortless vintage boho style in our Woodstock Wanderer Knit Cardi — a dreamy nod to the free-spirited fashion of the 70s. With its earthy retro-inspired tones and statement patchwork-look knit, this gorgeous cardi brings instant festival-chic energy to any outfit.</p><p data-start=\"382\" data-end=\"623\">Designed with a flattering deep V neckline, oversized button front, and a relaxed easy-to-layer fit, this knit looks beautiful thrown over a lace cami, your favourite denim, or paired with flowing boho layers for that carefree wanderer vibe.</p><p data-start=\"625\" data-end=\"851\">Earthy vintage-inspired boho tones<br data-start=\"659\" data-end=\"662\">Statement retro patchwork-look knit<br data-start=\"697\" data-end=\"700\">Deep V neckline with button front<br data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"736\">Relaxed comfortable fit<br data-start=\"759\" data-end=\"762\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Soft cozy knit feel<br data-start=\"781\" data-end=\"784\">Perfect layered with denim, lace, and your favourite boho staples</p><h5 data-start=\"625\" data-end=\"851\">35%WOOL 65%ACRYLIC</h5>Sizes: S-M Fits Australian Size 8 to 12M-L Fits Australian Size 14-16",
